## 🟤 Brown Switches – Best All-Round Choice

**Switch type:** Tactile  
**Typing feel:** Small bump, no click  
**Noise level:** Moderate  

Brown switches are often considered the **best mechanical keyboard switch for productivity**. They provide tactile feedback without the loud click found in Blue switches.

### Pros of Brown switches
- Noticeable feedback improves typing accuracy
- Quieter than Blue switches
- Very popular for office and home use

### Cons
- Tactile bump is subtle
- Slightly louder than Red switches

**Best for:**  
Typing-focused work, productivity, first-time mechanical keyboard users.

